algorithms.pseudocode:
TROPICAL-VOICE-LEADING(cf, lo, hi):
  P ← {lo, ..., hi}
  for x ∈ P: dp[0][x] ← forbiddenPenalty(x - cf[0])
  for k ← 1 to n-1:
    for x ∈ P:
      dp[k][x] ← min_{y ∈ P} [transitionCost(x, cf[k]) + leapPenalty(y, x) + dp[k-1][y]]
  return backtrack(argmin dp[n-1])

Time: O(n·P²), Space: O(n·P)
